# Android build output and local machine state.
#
# The repository root's .gitignore already covers `build/` at any depth, which
# catches android/build/ and android/app/build/. Everything below is what it
# does not cover. Kept here rather than added to the root file so the AM1 diff
# stays inside /android.
#
# The two keystore lines are the load-bearing ones: AM11 has the owner
# generating a release signing key locally, and losing control of it means
# losing the ability to update the app for every existing user. They are in
# place from the first commit, before any keystore exists.

.gradle/
.kotlin/
local.properties

# Signing material. Never committed, under any circumstances.
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
captures/

# Build artefacts and native intermediates
*.apk
*.aab
*.hprof
.cxx/
